# Pomodoro Timer — Plain HTML, CSS & JavaScript

No dependencies are needed here: the app is a single-page timer with DOM updates, which browsers handle natively via `setInterval`/`Date`, CSS animations for alerts, and the built-in `Audio` API. Adding a framework would only bloat it.

Save this as `index.html` and open it in a browser:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Pomodoro Timer</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --work-color: #e74c3c;
    --break-color: #27ae60;
    --bg: #1e1e2e;
    --card: #2a2a3e;
    --text: #f5f5f5;
    --muted: #a0a0b5;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .app {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ---- Mode badge ---- */
  .mode {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: .35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: .9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .05em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: var(--work-color);
  }
  .mode.break { background: var(--break-color); }

  /* ---- Timer ring ---- */
  .timer-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: min(260px, 70vw);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }
  svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; transform: rotate(-90deg); }
  .ring-bg   { fill: none; stroke: #3a3a52; stroke-width: 10; }
  .ring-progress {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--work-color);
    stroke-width: 10;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset .5s linear, stroke .3s;
  }
  .ring-progress.break { stroke: var(--break-color); }

  .time-display {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .time { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 10vw, 3.2rem); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .session-count { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; margin-top: .25rem; }

  /* ---- Buttons ---- */
  .controls { display: flex; gap: .6rem; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  button {
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: .6rem 1.4rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: .6rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: #3a3a52;
    color: var(--text);
